From: rgslide-linux <mainline@rgslide>
Subject: [PATCH] usb: phy: generic: match sprd,usb-dummy-phy for UMS9620 DWC3

On the Anbernic RG Slide (UMS9620) vendor device tree, dwc3@25100000 lists
usb-phy = <&dummyphy &ssphy>, where dummyphy uses compatible "sprd,usb-dummy-phy".
Bind it to usb-nop-xceiv so dwc3_core_get_phy() succeeds instead of deferring.

--- a/drivers/usb/phy/phy-generic.c
+++ b/drivers/usb/phy/phy-generic.c
@@ -338,6 +338,7 @@ static void usb_phy_generic_remove(struct platform_device *pdev)
 
 static const struct of_device_id nop_xceiv_dt_ids[] = {
 	{ .compatible = "usb-nop-xceiv" },
+	{ .compatible = "sprd,usb-dummy-phy" },
 	{ }
 };
 
